{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And he said.</b> Now he had already said to Moses before their arrival, by way of a messenger or in a written letter: 'I, your father-in-law Jethro [am coming], and your wife — who is the principal matter — and her two sons who are coming with her.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:35:28.909240892Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}